      "hash64": "BE6E7CB6C0633953",
      "text": "Hey, nice to meet you! I’m Nemona!\\c\\nYou’re Kieran, yeah?\\c\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)] told us all about you!\\c\\nLike how you’re great at Pokémon battles!\\nRight?![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
